UCRT-generation CRT DLLs staged by `oowintool --msvc-copy-dlls`.

configure copies them here from
`<VS>/VC/Redist/MSVC/<ver>/<arch>/Microsoft.VC14*.CRT/`
when `--with-cl-home` names a VS2015+ toolset directory.

Expected files (not checked in):

    vcruntime140.dll
    msvcp140.dll
    vcruntime140_1.dll   (x64, if the redist ships it)
    msvcp140_1.dll / msvcp140_2.dll / concrt140.dll  (if present)

These are the runtime the UCRT-generation binaries import.  The VC90
copies under ../msvcp90/ are not.  The UCRT itself is an operating-system
component on Windows 10 and is not staged here.
